# score: Romanza del hilo
# summary: classical guitar romanza on the weave voice — guitar limit, waking lattice, chirality mirror, harmonic coda
# tempo: 80
# time: 3/4
# key: Em
# bars: 28
# reverb: 1.4
# master: rms=-16

# text @b1: a romanza for the impossible guitar. three hands of one instrument:
# text @b1: la voz sings apoyando (pos deep, pick soft), el arpegio rings tirando,
# text @b1: el bordon walks underneath. couple stays low — the lattice only breathes.
# text @b9: la vuelta al sol — the lattice wakes: couple rises, the orbit turns,
# text @b9: curvature lets the loud courses bend the quiet ones toward them.
# text @b17: la memoria — the same thread, walked backwards: chirality mirrored,
# text @b17: hand over the soundhole. what returns is not what left.
# text @b25: coda — plucked at the exact midpoint of the string, the even
# text @b25: harmonics vanish: bells that are really physics.

# instruments:
#   vo = la voz (treble, synth=weave, sus=4.5, damp=0.20, pos=0.34, pick=0.32, body=0.55, stiff=0.10, tension=4, courses=9, dimension=1.9, couple=0.055, chirality=0.6, orbit=0.12, orbit_depth=0.3, curvature=0.08, strum=0, send=0.22, gain=1)
#   ar = el arpegio (treble, synth=weave, sus=2.6, damp=0.30, pos=0.16, pick=0.48, body=0.45, stiff=0.08, tension=3, courses=9, dimension=1.9, couple=0.055, chirality=0.6, orbit=0.12, orbit_depth=0.3, curvature=0.08, strum=0, send=0.18, gain=-4)
#   bj = el bordon (bass, synth=weave, sus=3.5, damp=0.34, pos=0.12, pick=0.36, body=0.50, stiff=0.12, tension=3, courses=7, dimension=1.9, couple=0.05, chirality=0.6, orbit=0.10, orbit_depth=0.2, curvature=0.05, strum=0, send=0.12)
#   vm = la voz en memoria (treble, synth=weave, sus=4.5, damp=0.20, pos=0.40, pick=0.28, body=0.55, stiff=0.10, tension=4, courses=9, dimension=1.9, couple=0.055, chirality=-0.6, orbit=0.12, orbit_depth=0.3, curvature=0.08, strum=0, send=0.26, gain=1)
#   am = el arpegio en memoria (treble, synth=weave, sus=2.6, damp=0.30, pos=0.22, pick=0.40, body=0.45, stiff=0.08, tension=3, courses=9, dimension=1.9, couple=0.055, chirality=-0.6, orbit=0.12, orbit_depth=0.3, curvature=0.08, strum=0, send=0.22, gain=-4)
#   bm = el bordon en memoria (bass, synth=weave, sus=3.5, damp=0.34, pos=0.14, pick=0.32, body=0.50, stiff=0.12, tension=3, courses=7, dimension=1.9, couple=0.05, chirality=-0.6, orbit=0.10, orbit_depth=0.2, curvature=0.05, strum=0, send=0.16)

